unlock directly from windows
Pre-requiusites -
-- 1. Install git for windows (preferably git portable, or using winget but any git will do)
-- 2. install ipad drivers (bonjour, and ipad drivers = AppleMobileDeviceSupport64.msi)
-- 3. 3utools to confirm ipad works and connects properly (may have an option to install the required drivers to connect to ipad via USB)
-- 4. git clone this repo, then go into the ipad2-unlock directly
-- 5. ensure that once the ipad2 is connected the machine, the 'trust'option is entered on the ipad2 device.
run unlock.bat, which will invoke the right command to unlock the ipad2 device.
